":"呂望","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"王昶","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:u0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"魏帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","unresolved_kind":"unresolved_source_person","interpretation_note":"本句所述為魏帝曾賜春服，時間未定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:m0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAH","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line015:m0114","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"raw_start":442,"raw_end":572,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shantao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021","text":"及羊祜執政，時人欲危裴秀，濤正色保持之。由是失權臣意，出為冀州刺史，加甯遠將軍。冀州俗薄，無相推轂。濤甄拔隱屈，搜訪賢才，旌命三十餘人，皆顯名當時。人懷慕尚，風俗頗革。轉北中郎將，督鄴城守事。入為侍中，遷尚書。以母老辭職，詔曰：「君雖乃心在於色養，然職有上下，旦夕不廢醫藥，且當割情，以隆在公。」濤心求退，表疏數十上，久乃見聽。除議郎，帝以濤清儉無以供養，特給日契，加賜床帳茵褥。禮秩崇重，時莫為比。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"羊祜","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"裴秀","kind":"person","person_id":"057_a27_29b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line021:m0170","start":170,"end":171,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":21,"last_line":21,"raw_start":876,"raw_end":1078,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shantao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023","text":"後除太常卿，以疾不就。會遭母喪，歸鄉里。濤年逾耳順，居喪過禮，負土成墳，手植松柏。詔曰：「吾所共致化者，官人之職是也。方今風欲陵遲，人心進動，宜崇明好惡，鎮以退讓。山太常雖尚居諒闇，情在難奪，方今務殷，何得遂其志邪！其以濤為吏部尚書。」濤辭以喪病，章表懇切。會元皇后崩，遂扶興還洛。逼迫詔命，自力就職。前後選舉，周遍內外，而並得其才。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"w5t_irt_48t","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文親稱用於繫接未名母的喪事，排除於姓名別稱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line023:m0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"山太常","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status"